---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Datafore Analytics Inc. handles personal information collected through this website."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-500">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-ink mt-10 max-w-none space-y-6 text-ink-700">
      <p>
        Datafore Analytics Inc. ("Datafore", "we", "us") is based in Burnaby, British Columbia, Canada. This policy
        covers the personal information we collect through this website. It does not yet cover the Datafore
        analytics platform itself, which is under active development — a dedicated policy will apply once that
        product is available to clinics.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you email us, call us, or otherwise contact Datafore through this site, we collect the information you
        choose to share — such as your name, contact details, clinic name, and the content of your message.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use this information only to respond to you and to follow up about Datafore's platform, including early
        access. We do not sell personal information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">Where it's handled</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to store and process data in Canada, and we handle personal information in line with British
        Columbia's Personal Information Protection Act (PIPA) and the federal Personal Information Protection and
        Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA).
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-900">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy or your information can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:info@datafore.ca" class="text-brand-600 underline">info@datafore.ca</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
